      "line": [],
      "spoken": "Against the bishop to c4, Black might wriggle out with the knight to f5, so the bishop to g6 is far more accurate.",
      "reanchor": true
    },
    {
      "ply": 13,
      "t": 601,
      "fen": "rnbq1b1r/ppp1pkp1/5nBp/8/8/8/PPP2PPP/RNBQK2R b KQ - 1 7",
      "line": [
        "Bg6+"
      ],
      "spoken": "The bishop to g6 with check.",
