      "fen": "rnbqkb1r/ppp1pppp/5n2/6N1/4p3/3P4/PPP2PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 0 4",
      "line": [],
      "spoken": "But the thing is, Black can just play the knight to c6 and be better — I'm giving you a road map for these scenarios.",
      "reanchor": true
    },
    {
      "ply": 8,
      "t": 615,
